  <item>
    <title>恋爱六周年大揭秘：爱情这该死的魅力！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664ccf8dc59d1e5757c4ce19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664ccf8dc59d1e5757c4ce19</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 May 2024 16:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>现在的年轻人推崇不婚不育和独居生活，并不是不再需要恋爱了，恰恰相反，很多人还是很渴望一种美好的、能够为自己带来滋养的恋爱。刚好今天晚上的十点钟，就是我们恋爱六周年纪念了，在这六年的相爱相杀里，我们也在认真、虔诚地学习着恋爱这门功课，所以就想借此机会做一个复盘，就当作是给两人的一个小礼物，也想和朋友们随便唠唠~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙【收听线】可以直戳自己感兴趣的part!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 爱情是源于好奇还是聊得来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">00:02:57</a> 恋爱中非常触动你的那些瞬间？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:9:35</a> 尊重伴侣，TA不能长成你爱的模样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">00:15:55</a> 恋爱中如何进行磨合？如何形成彼此舒服的沟通模式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1839">00:30:39</a>越道歉越生气，如何道歉才是正确操作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">00:32:15</a> 恋爱这么久会腻吗？有没有对其他异性产生过心动的感觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">00:38:44</a> 有时候会害怕自己只是爱上一种符号？爱具体的人而不是爱爱情本身。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">00:41:40</a> 警惕爱情完美主义，爱情老手也会受伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">00:44:52</a> 你认为恋爱要谈越多次越好嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">00:47:48</a> 异地恋的经历和如何处理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">00:51:25</a> 物质堆砌的爱情到底可靠吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">00:54:29</a> 长久的恋爱是不占有，给对方充分的生长空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3554">00:59:14</a> 爱是一面镜子，窥见自身的弱点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3828">01:03:48</a> 拥有长久的恋爱以后，还会孤独吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">01:06:39</a> 关于深度对谈在爱情里的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4336">01:12:16</a> 大总结：做哪些事情可以帮助亲密关系长久化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>😅杰西卡日记大放送！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuxK3cbOf_9_AmBVQ_AOe5f1d4lJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl30KyACYL9QmZF5vhib-jyChTkK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播🎙️：卜卜&amp;老迈克</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑&amp;运营&amp;文案：卜卜</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>De Luca&amp;Leo——House</span></p><span></span><p><span>高中正義——Straight From Your Heart</span></p><span></span><p><span>As It Was——Olivia Keast</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pinback——Loro</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来找我玩儿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtAV1GMB1KH3Qf8Yj6RBCwFO5BKp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你也喜欢播客/音乐，欢迎来到【5%的听觉宇宙】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，你可以找到志同道合的听友，一起分享和声音有关的一切美好，也可能会收获很多宝藏安利！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkH1MZgtlA6Apvco_XdftIfwpjUy.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqCf2pbAyIEaUifLWTGO9p-pgiE6.m4a" length="77518885" type="audio/mp4"/>
